    (effects (font (size 3.81 3.81)) (justify left))
    (uuid "ba0a9c1a-1fa2-463f-9b49-750542f1bbc7")
  )
  (text "nRF52833 (integrated 2.4GHz radio) + PAW3311 + BQ24074 + 5x Kailh + scroll encoder | SINGLE 1.9V SYSTEM RAIL" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left))
    (uuid "7b5a4d4a-69c3-49b0-8a13-4568379a4048")
  )
  (text "SYSTEM RAIL = 1.9V: PAW3311 VDD abs max 2.1V -> MCU + sensor share 1V9" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120.65 102.87 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "4c01d16a-3169-4670-8309-81fa046079c0")
  )
  (text "(nRF52833 runs 1.7-3.6V, no level shift). Status LED from VSYS via Q2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120.65 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e0671dfb-3fd3-4d95-b556-90a333beb915")
  )
  (text "USB-C: CHARGE-ONLY. D+/D-/SBU float; CC1/CC2 separate 5.1k pulldowns. nRF USB pins unconnected per Nordic no-USB reference (config 6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "eac71fb9-bd34-4d3c-ba79-f2ad6ed30a3e")
  )
  (text "BQ24074: EN2=VSYS, EN1=GND -> input limit ILIM = 1610/3.24k = 497mA. ISET 2.0k -> ICHG = 445mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 179.07 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "f1de709c-2d44-485c-89d5-a22844d9ec90")
  )
  (text "TS = 10k fixed to GND (always-valid). For pack temp sensing fit 10k NTC (103AT) instead. TMR/ITERM float = default timers / 10% term." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 182.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "dda117fc-72f4-46dd-86ff-fa50b2aa907b")
  )
  (text "v5.2: C36 10uF ceramic at BAT pins - BQ24074 Table 7-1 mandatory bypass (battery is on a cable)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 186.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "031a4ec3-142a-47c0-8ad3-de84520cdd33")
  )
  (text "v5.2: divider gated HIGH-SIDE (Q3 P-FET + R25 pull-up): VBAT_EN low -> Q3 off, ADC node held at GND by R9." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 242.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "ae77cf9d-758f-4ae7-acfb-7be0b26e6040")
  )
  (text "v5.3: R25 = 47k (Q1 worst-case IDSS 5uA x 47k = 0.24V << Q3 Vgs(th) min 0.5V - margin doubled)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "09e42e51-6ff9-4825-be82-73d383e9b677")
  )
  (text "v5.3: sensor board features EXACT per PixArt Table 9: full aperture cutout + optical-axis notch," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 302.26 228.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "c361168c-9960-4d57-a8a8-5c503e0b2cbb")
  )
  (text "R0.90x2.00 LED stadium, 2x lens guide-post holes; D2 pads per Table 9 (custom fp, verify vs LED P/N)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 302.26 232.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e82d7e22-8818-4f37-a17b-29069fa652ea")
  )
  (text "True zero standby drain; AIN0 can never float above VDD (old low-side gate leaked ~11uA via the ESD clamp)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "75c9da70-226a-4ca5-9947-a31645de195e")
  )
